    {
      "source": "Create a new instance of <a href=\"SingleSessionFactoryLookup.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.cql.session.lookup\"><code>SingleSessionFactoryLookup</code></a> given <a href=\"../../../../SessionFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra\"><code>SessionFactory</code></a>.",
      "translation": "根据 <a href=\"../../../../SessionFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra\"><code>SessionFactory</code></a> 创建一个新的 <a href=\"SingleSessionFactoryLookup.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.cql.session.lookup\"><code>SingleSessionFactoryLookup</code></a> 实例。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Implementations must implement this method to retrieve the <a href=\"../../../../SessionFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra\"><code>SessionFactory</code></a> identified by the given name from\ntheir backing store.",
      "translation": "实现类必须实现此方法，以从其存储中检索给定名称所标识的<a href=\"../../../../SessionFactory.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.cassandra 中的接口\"><code>SessionFactory</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
