    {
      "source": "An implementation of <a href=\"SessionFactoryLookup.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.cql.session.lookup\"><code>SessionFactoryLookup</code></a> that simply wraps a single given <a href=\"../../../../SessionFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra\"><code>SessionFactory</code></a>, returned\nfor any session factory name. Useful for testing or environments that provide only one <a href=\"../../../../SessionFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.cassandra\"><code>SessionFactory</code></a>.",
      "translation": "一个实现了<a href=\"SessionFactoryLookup.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.cassandra.core.cql.session.lookup 中的接口\"><code>SessionFactoryLookup</code></a>的类，它简单地包装了一个给定的<a href=\"../../../../SessionFactory.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.cassandra 中的接口\"><code>SessionFactory</code></a>，并针对任何会话工厂名称返回该对象。此实现适用于测试或仅提供单个<a href=\"../../../../SessionFactory.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.cassandra 中的接口\"><code>SessionFactory</code></a>的环境。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
